 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `dotenv get --default VALUE` prints `VALUE` and exits with code 0 when the key is missing or has no value; keys set to an empty string still print empty
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - Fix a package build deprecation warning caused by a non-string `license` value in `pyproject.toml` by [@kurtmckee] in [#648]
